      "reading": "スタイル",
      "reason": "'スタイル' (sutairu) is a common loanword in Japanese that covers a much broader range of meanings of 'style,' including fashion, personal appearance, figure, and general manner. It is a more natural and comprehensive translation for the general concept of 'style' for a learner."
